{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"React Native 性能优化与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/production-engineering/performance-optimization","wordCount":1111,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-native-性能优化与调优\">React Native 性能优化与调优</h1><p>移动端性能问题与 Web 端有显著不同：用户对触摸响应延迟有极低的容忍阈值（超过 100ms 就能感知），滚动卡顿在移动设备上比桌面端更明显，内存限制也远比桌面端严格（低端 Android 设备可能只有 2GB 总内存）。系统性地优化 React Native 性能，需要先学会用正确的工具定位问题，再针对性地应用优化手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>JS 线程</strong>：所有 JavaScript 代码和 React 协调运行的单线程；阻塞 JS 线程会导致 UI 无响应——用户点击没有反馈、列表滚动卡顿。</li>\n<li><strong>UI 线程帧率</strong>：目标 60fps（16.7ms/帧）或 120fps（8.3ms/帧，支持 ProMotion 的 iOS 设备）；超过帧预算的工作会导致掉帧。</li>\n<li><strong>TTI（Time to Interactive）</strong>：从用户启动应用到首屏可交互的时间；冷启动优化的核心指标，直接影响用户留存。</li>\n<li><strong>React DevTools Performance Panel</strong>：React Native 0.82+ 内置的性能分析工具，可视化 JS 线程和 React 渲染的帧时间；是定位性能瓶颈的首选工具。</li>\n<li><strong>useMemo / useCallback</strong>：React 的记忆化 API，用于避免昂贵计算和引用稳定性问题（阻止不必要的子组件重渲染）；React 19 的 Compiler 可以自动处理大部分场景，减少手动优化需要。</li>\n<li><strong>InteractionManager</strong>：React Native 内置 API，允许将非紧急工作（数据预加载、日志发送）推迟到当前动画和过渡动画完成后执行，避免影响动画流畅度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"性能分析-定位瓶颈的正确顺序\">性能分析：定位瓶颈的正确顺序</h2><p>优化前不做分析等于猜谜——移动端性能问题的根源往往出人意料。应按以下顺序收集数据：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Start[怀疑性能问题]&#10;    Step1[React Native DevTools\\nPerformance Panel\\n定位掉帧帧]&#10;    Step2[分析掉帧帧的\\nJS 调用栈]&#10;    Step3{问题在 JS 还是原生？}&#10;    JSProblem[JS 线程问题\\n优化 React 渲染\\n减少 JS 计算]&#10;    NativeProblem[UI 线程问题\\n检查原生视图层级\\n减少阴影/圆角]&#10;    Fix[针对性优化]&#10;&#10;    Start --&gt; Step1&#10;    Step1 --&gt; Step2&#10;    Step2 --&gt; Step3&#10;    Step3 --&gt; JSProblem&#10;    Step3 --&gt; NativeProblem&#10;    JSProblem --&gt; Fix&#10;    NativeProblem --&gt; Fix\">graph TD\n    Start[怀疑性能问题]\n    Step1[React Native DevTools\\nPerformance Panel\\n定位掉帧帧]\n    Step2[分析掉帧帧的\\nJS 调用栈]\n    Step3{问题在 JS 还是原生？}\n    JSProblem[JS 线程问题\\n优化 React 渲染\\n减少 JS 计算]\n    NativeProblem[UI 线程问题\\n检查原生视图层级\\n减少阴影/圆角]\n    Fix[针对性优化]\n\n    Start --&gt; Step1\n    Step1 --&gt; Step2\n    Step2 --&gt; Step3\n    Step3 --&gt; JSProblem\n    Step3 --&gt; NativeProblem\n    JSProblem --&gt; Fix\n    NativeProblem --&gt; Fix</pre><p><strong>启动 Performance Panel</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在 Metro 输出中按 j 键，或在应用中 摇一摇 → Open DevTools&#10;# 在 DevTools 的 Performance 标签页点击 Record 开始录制\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 Metro 输出中按 j 键，或在应用中 摇一摇 → Open DevTools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 DevTools 的 Performance 标签页点击 Record 开始录制</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Performance Panel 会以时间线形式展示每帧中 JS 线程、UI 线程、React 渲染的工作分布。掉帧的帧会以红色高亮标记。</p>\n<h2 id=\"javascript-层优化\">JavaScript 层优化</h2><h3 id=\"react-渲染优化\">React 渲染优化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 每次父组件渲染都重新创建函数——导致 PostCard 不必要重渲染&#10;function FeedScreen({ posts }: { posts: Post[] }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;FlatList&#10;      data={posts}&#10;      renderItem={({ item }) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;PostCard&#10;          post={item}&#10;          onLike={() =&gt; handleLike(item.id)}  // 每次渲染都是新函数&#10;        /&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 稳定化 renderItem 引用&#10;const renderItem = useCallback(&#10;  ({ item }: { item: Post }) =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;PostCard post={item} onLike={handleLike} /&gt;&#10;  ),&#10;  [handleLike]&#10;);&#10;&#10;// ✅ 如果 PostCard 频繁接收相同 props，使用 React.memo 跳过渲染&#10;const PostCard = React.memo(function PostCard({ post, onLike }: PostCardProps) {&#10;  return (/* ... */);&#10;}, (prevProps, nextProps) =&gt; {&#10;  // 自定义比较函数：只在 post.id 或 likedState 变化时重渲染&#10;  return prevProps.post.id === nextProps.post.id &amp;&amp;&#10;         prevProps.post.likedByMe === nextProps.post.likedByMe;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 每次父组件渲染都重新创建函数——导致 PostCard 不必要重渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeedScreen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">posts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">posts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">FlatList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{posts}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      renderItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{({ item }) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;PostCard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          post</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{item}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          onLike</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{() => </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleLike</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.id)}  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每次渲染都是新函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 稳定化 renderItem 引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> renderItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PostCard post</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{item} onLike</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleLike} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [handleLike]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 如果 PostCard 频繁接收相同 props，使用 React.memo 跳过渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PostCard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> React.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">memo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostCard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">onLike</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostCardProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* ... */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prevProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nextProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 自定义比较函数：只在 post.id 或 likedState 变化时重渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevProps.post.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextProps.post.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         prevProps.post.likedByMe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextProps.post.likedByMe;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>React 19 Compiler 注意</strong>：React 19 的编译器会自动分析并插入 <code>memo</code>、<code>useMemo</code>、<code>useCallback</code>，减少手动优化的需要。但在 Compiler 稳定前（或已有大型代码库中），仍需手动处理高频重渲染的组件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"启动时间优化\">启动时间优化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hermes 预编译字节码</td>\n<td>减少 30-40% 解析时间</td>\n<td>构建流程中启用 Hermes（默认开启）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metro <code>inlineRequires: true</code></td>\n<td>延迟模块加载到使用时</td>\n<td><code>metro.config.js</code> 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减少首屏依赖</td>\n<td>降低初始 Bundle 解析量</td>\n<td>懒加载非首屏路由的组件和库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推迟非关键初始化</td>\n<td>减少启动时的同步工作</td>\n<td><code>InteractionManager.runAfterInteractions</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React Navigation 懒加载</td>\n<td>Tab 只渲染当前 Tab</td>\n<td>Tab.Navigator 默认 <code>lazy: true</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { InteractionManager } from &#39;react-native&#39;;&#10;&#10;function HomeScreen() {&#10;  const [analyticsReady, setAnalyticsReady] = useState(false);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    // 等待过渡动画完成后再初始化分析 SDK&#10;    const task = InteractionManager.runAfterInteractions(() =&gt; {&#10;      Analytics.init();&#10;      setAnalyticsReady(true);&#10;    });&#10;    return () =&gt; task.cancel();&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return (/* ... */);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { InteractionManager } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-native'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HomeScreen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">analyticsReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setAnalyticsReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 等待过渡动画完成后再初始化分析 SDK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> InteractionManager.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runAfterInteractions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      Analytics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;-